{"seq":1,"slug":"solid-state-batteries","title":"固态电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/next-gen-batteries/solid-state-batteries","wordCount":2020,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"固态电池\">固态电池</h1><p>固态电池被誉为锂电池的&quot;终极形态&quot;——用固态电解质取代易燃的液态有机电解液，理论上可同时实现更高能量密度、更好安全性和更长寿命。然而，从实验室到量产的鸿沟远比想象中更深。截至 2026 年，全球固态电池正处于从&quot;中试验证&quot;到&quot;小批量装车&quot;的关键拐点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>固态电池的本质是<strong>用固态电解质替代理液态电解质</strong>，从而同时攻克安全与能量密度两大瓶颈。理解以下概念才能判断其真实进展：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>固态电解质三条路线</strong>：氧化物（稳定但界面差）、硫化物（电导率最高但怕水）、聚合物（柔性好但性能瓶颈）——路线选择决定了整套工艺与设备体系。</li>\n<li><strong>离子电导率是准入门槛</strong>：固态电解质必须达到接近液态的离子电导率（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> S/cm 量级）才有实用价值，硫化物是目前唯一达标且可加工的体系。</li>\n<li><strong>固固界面是核心矛盾</strong>：与液态电解质可&quot;自愈&quot;不同，固体之间无法自发贴合，充放电体积变化会导致接触损失；空间电荷层、接触损失、枝晶穿透是三大界面难题。</li>\n<li><strong>渐进式路线图</strong>：液态→半固态→准固态→全固态，通过逐级降低液态含量降低风险，而非一步到位。</li>\n<li><strong>理想与现实的差距</strong>：实验室目标（500+ Wh/kg、5000+ 次）与当前实际（350-400 Wh/kg、300-800 次）之间隔着一整个产业化周期。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个常见误解：把&quot;固态 = 绝对安全、一定高能量&quot;。固态电解质消除了易燃液态组分，但界面不稳定、循环寿命短、成本高（当前为液态的 1.5-3 倍）仍是现实约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三大固态电解质路线\">三大固态电解质路线</h2><p>固态电解质按材料体系分为氧化物、硫化物和聚合物三条技术路线，各有优劣：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>氧化物（LLZO/LATP）</th>\n<th>硫化物（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>PS</mtext><mn>5</mn></msub><mtext>Cl</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Li}_6\\text{PS}_5\\text{Cl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cl</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</th>\n<th>聚合物（PEO）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>离子电导率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> S/cm</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> S/cm</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> S/cm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电化学窗口</td>\n<td>0-6V（最宽）</td>\n<td>0-5V</td>\n<td>0-4V（窄）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机械性质</td>\n<td>硬脆（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> ~150 GPa）</td>\n<td>较软（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> ~20 GPa）</td>\n<td>柔韧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>界面接触</td>\n<td>差（刚性接触）</td>\n<td>中（可热压变形）</td>\n<td>好（柔性贴合）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空气稳定性</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>极差（遇水产 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>S</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_2\\text{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S</span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量产难度</td>\n<td>高温烧结、致密化困难</td>\n<td>无水无氧环境、设备昂贵</td>\n<td>工艺简单但性能瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>硫化物路线当前被公认为最有希望率先实现高性能全固态电池——其离子电导率已达到甚至超过液态电解液水平（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> S/cm），且在加热/加压条件下可与电极形成良好接触。宁德时代、丰田、比亚迪均主攻硫化物路线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"界面问题-固态电池的核心难题\">界面问题：固态电池的核心难题</h2><p>固态电池最大的技术瓶颈不在电解质本身，而在&quot;界面&quot;——两个固体之间如何维持纳米级别的持续紧密接触。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[固固界面挑战] --&gt; B[空间电荷层]&#10;    A --&gt; C[接触损失]&#10;    A --&gt; D[锂枝晶穿透]&#10;    B --&gt; E[界面处锂离子耗尽层]&#10;    B --&gt; F[高界面电阻]&#10;    C --&gt; G[充放电体积变化]&#10;    C --&gt; H[界面脱粘]&#10;    D --&gt; I[晶界渗透]&#10;    D --&gt; J[短路风险]&#10;    E --&gt; K[表面修饰/缓冲层]&#10;    G --&gt; L[外部加压 5-50 MPa]&#10;    I --&gt; M[致密化 + 无缺陷薄膜]\">graph TD\n    A[固固界面挑战] --&gt; B[空间电荷层]\n    A --&gt; C[接触损失]\n    A --&gt; D[锂枝晶穿透]\n    B --&gt; E[界面处锂离子耗尽层]\n    B --&gt; F[高界面电阻]\n    C --&gt; G[充放电体积变化]\n    C --&gt; H[界面脱粘]\n    D --&gt; I[晶界渗透]\n    D --&gt; J[短路风险]\n    E --&gt; K[表面修饰/缓冲层]\n    G --&gt; L[外部加压 5-50 MPa]\n    I --&gt; M[致密化 + 无缺陷薄膜]</pre><p><strong>空间电荷层</strong>：正极材料（如 NCM）与固态电解质接触时，由于锂化学势差异，在界面形成锂离子贫乏的空间电荷层，宽度可达 5-20 nm，导致高界面电阻。解决方案是在界面引入缓冲层（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Li</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mtext>InCl</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Li}_3\\text{InCl}_6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Li</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">InCl</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>LiNbO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LiNbO}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LiNbO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 涂覆）。</p>\n<p><strong>接触损失</strong>：锂电池充放电时正极体积变化可达 5-8%，固体界面无法像液体那样&quot;自愈&quot;。每次循环都可能产生新的空隙。目前的工程方案是施加外部堆叠压力（5-50 MPa），但这增加了系统重量和复杂度。</p>\n<p><strong>枝晶穿透</strong>：反直觉的是，软锂金属可以穿透硬陶瓷。锂沿晶界和缺陷处&quot;填隙生长&quot;，最终刺穿电解质导致短路。QuantumScape 声称其 QSE-5 柔性陶瓷隔膜通过无缺陷致密薄膜（&lt;30 μm）解决了此问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"半固态到全固态路线图\">半固态到全固态路线图</h2><p>业界共识是全固态电池不会一步到位，而是经历&quot;液态→半固态→准固态→全固态&quot;的渐进过程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>液态含量</th>\n<th>能量密度</th>\n<th>时间窗口</th>\n<th>代表产品</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>液态锂电</td>\n<td>&gt;80%</td>\n<td>250-300 Wh/kg</td>\n<td>当前主流</td>\n<td>NCM+石墨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半固态</td>\n<td>5-20%</td>\n<td>350-400 Wh/kg</td>\n<td>2024-2026 量产</td>\n<td>蔚来 150kWh 包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准固态</td>\n<td>1-5%</td>\n<td>380-450 Wh/kg</td>\n<td>2026-2028 中试</td>\n<td>卫蓝/清陶产品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全固态</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>400-500+ Wh/kg</td>\n<td>2027 装车/2030 量产</td>\n<td>丰田/CATL/BYD</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2024 年蔚来 150kWh 半固态电池包已量产，采用卫蓝新能源的原位固化技术，电芯能量密度 360 Wh/kg。这标志着&quot;半固态&quot;已完成从概念到商品化的跨越。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全球主要玩家与路线选择\">全球主要玩家与路线选择</h2><p>截至 2026 年，全球固态电池竞赛已形成清晰的势力格局：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>企业/机构</th>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>关键进展（截至 2026）</th>\n<th>目标时间线</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>丰田</td>\n<td>硫化物</td>\n<td>静冈试产线 2026 投产，1300+ 专利</td>\n<td>2027 装车，2030 量产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宁德时代</td>\n<td>硫化物</td>\n<td>中试线已建成，20Ah 样品试制，千人团队</td>\n<td>2027 小批量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比亚迪</td>\n<td>硫化物</td>\n<td>深圳坪山 2GWh 中试线 2026.2 投产</td>\n<td>2027 示范装车，2030 量产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广汽集团</td>\n<td>硫化物</td>\n<td>国内首条大容量全固态产线，400-500 Wh/kg</td>\n<td>2026 装车实验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QuantumScape</td>\n<td>氧化物</td>\n<td>QSE-5 样品出货，PowerCo 40GWh 协议</td>\n<td>2027 量产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Samsung SDI</td>\n<td>硫化物</td>\n<td>SolidStack 袋式全固态电池</td>\n<td>2027 H2 量产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>国轩高科</td>\n<td>氧化物</td>\n<td>0.2GWh 中试线，金石电池发布</td>\n<td>2027 小批量装车</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>比亚迪采用&quot;中试线迭代 + 逐步放大&quot;策略——坪山 2GWh 中试线全年产量仅够 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>2500 辆车，但通过快速迭代优化工艺。后续重庆璧山基地首期 20GWh 量产线预计 2026 Q3 启动建设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"量产挑战-成本-良率与设备\">量产挑战：成本、良率与设备</h2><p>固态电池从实验室到量产面临&quot;制造地狱&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战维度</th>\n<th>具体问题</th>\n<th>当前状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电解质制备</td>\n<td>硫化物需无水无氧（露点 &lt;-60°C）</td>\n<td>干燥间设备昂贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>界面工程</td>\n<td>纳米级涂覆均匀性</td>\n<td>良率不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>堆叠压力</td>\n<td>5-50 MPa 恒压维持</td>\n<td>增加系统重量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备国产化</td>\n<td>高温烧结炉、真空干燥设备</td>\n<td>核心设备 70%+ 进口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本估算</td>\n<td>全固态电芯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span></span></span></span>1.5-3x 液态电芯</td>\n<td>2030 目标&quot;固液同价&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产业链成熟度</td>\n<td>硫化物电解质批量供应不足</td>\n<td>2025 年&lt;500 吨/年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"性能对比-理想与现实的差距\">性能对比：理想与现实的差距</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>液态锂电（NCM811）</th>\n<th>全固态（目标）</th>\n<th>全固态（当前实际）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>能量密度</td>\n<td>280-300 Wh/kg</td>\n<td>500+ Wh/kg</td>\n<td>350-400 Wh/kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环寿命</td>\n<td>1000-2000 次</td>\n<td>5000+ 次</td>\n<td>300-800 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>需防护设计</td>\n<td>本质安全</td>\n<td>安全但界面不稳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快充能力</td>\n<td>4-6C</td>\n<td>10C+</td>\n<td>1-2C（界面限制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工作温度</td>\n<td>-20~60°C</td>\n<td>-40~100°C</td>\n<td>25~60°C（目前）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>$80-100/kWh</td>\n<td>目标同价</td>\n<td>$200-400/kWh</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>差距主要来源于界面阻抗和循环稳定性不足。业界共识是：2027 年实现小批量装车验证，2030 年&quot;固液同价&quot;后大规模应用——这意味着固态电池还需要 3-5 年的产业化攻坚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>固态电池用固态电解质替代理液态电解液，目标是同时获得高能量密度、高安全性和长寿命。</li>\n<li>三条技术路线中，硫化物因电导率最高、可加工性最好而被主流企业主攻，但需无水无氧环境。</li>\n<li>最大的技术瓶颈是固固界面：空间电荷层、接触损失、枝晶穿透共同导致界面阻抗高、循环寿命短。</li>\n<li>产业化遵循&quot;液态→半固态→准固态→全固态&quot;的渐进路径，半固态已率先量产装车。</li>\n<li>成本、良率、设备国产化构成&quot;制造地狱&quot;，全固态电芯成本当前为液态的 1.5-3 倍，目标 2030 年固液同价。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"固态电池","id":"固态电池"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三大固态电解质路线","id":"三大固态电解质路线"},{"level":2,"text":"界面问题：固态电池的核心难题","id":"界面问题-固态电池的核心难题"},{"level":2,"text":"半固态到全固态路线图","id":"半固态到全固态路线图"},{"level":2,"text":"全球主要玩家与路线选择","id":"全球主要玩家与路线选择"},{"level":2,"text":"量产挑战：成本、良率与设备","id":"量产挑战-成本-良率与设备"},{"level":2,"text":"性能对比：理想与现实的差距","id":"性能对比-理想与现实的差距"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"系统集成工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/lithium-battery-systems/system-integration-engineering"},"next":{"title":"钠离子电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/next-gen-batteries/sodium-ion-batteries"}}